# Deployed location of the shadcn registry — the base URL under which
# `/r/<name>.json` is served (e.g. button.json, version.json, theme.json).
#
# Single source of truth for the registry host across the repo:
#   - apps/web              → site origin + metadata (lib/site_name.ts)
#   - packages/ui build     → expands {{REGISTRY_LOCATION}} in registry output
#   - release-drift-audit   → which endpoint the channel check fetches
#
# Leave unset to use the default (the current production deployment). In CI,
# override with a `REGISTRY_LOCATION` repository variable; on Vercel, set it in
# the project's Environment Variables.
REGISTRY_LOCATION=https://ui.digital.nsw.gov.au/registry
